{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09347","headline":"游灵岩寺 · 韦应物","name":"游灵岩寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"始入松路永，独忻山寺幽。\n不知临绝槛，乃见西江流。\n吴岫分烟景，楚甸散林丘。\n方悟关塞眇，重轸故园愁。\n闻钟戒归骑，憩涧惜良游。\n地疎泉谷狭，春深草木稠。\n兹焉赏未极，清景期杪秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}